{"speciesId":172,"names":{"fr":"Pichu","es":"Pichu","en":"Pichu","ja":"ピチュー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It is not yet skilled at storing electricity. It may send out a jolt if amused or startled."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"Despite its small size, it can zap even adult humans. However, if it does so, it also surprises itself."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"It is unskilled at storing electric power. Any kind of shock causes it to discharge energy spontaneously."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"PICHU charges itself with electricity more easily on days with thunderclouds or when the air is very dry. You can hear the crackling of static electricity coming off this POKéMON."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"When PICHU plays with others, it may short out electricity with another PICHU, creating a shower of sparks. In that event, this POKéMON will begin crying, startled by the flash of sparks."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It is still inept at retaining electricity. When it is startled, it discharges power accidentally. It gets better at holding power as it grows older."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Despite its small size, it can zap even adult humans. However, if it does so, it also surprises itself."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It is not yet skilled at storing electricity. It may send out a jolt if amused or startled."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"The electric pouches on its cheeks are still small. They cannot store much electricity yet."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It plays with others by touching tails and setting off sparks. This appears to be a test of courage."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"The electric sacs in its cheeks are small. If even a little electricity leaks, it becomes shocked."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It is not yet skilled at storing electricity. It may send out a jolt if amused or startled."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Despite its small size, it can zap even adult humans. However, if it does so, it also surprises itself."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Les poches électriques de ses joues sont encore petites, mais risquent de l’électrocuter."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"The electric sacs in its cheeks are small. If even a little electricity leaks, it becomes shocked."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Les poches électriques de ses joues sont encore petites, mais risquent de l’électrocuter."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"The electric sacs in its cheeks are small. If even a little electricity leaks, it becomes shocked."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"The electric sacs in its cheeks are small. If even a little electricity leaks, it becomes shocked."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"The electric sacs in its cheeks are small. If even a little electricity leaks, it becomes shocked."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il prouve son courage en touchant la queue électrifiée de ses pairs."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Cuando juegan, se tocan las colas y emiten chispas. Al parecer, es una prueba de valor."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It plays with others by touching tails and setting off sparks. This appears to be a test of courage."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"仲間と 尻尾の 先を あわせて 火花を 飛ばす 遊びをする。 度胸試しを しているらしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il ne sait pas encore stocker l’électricité. Il envoie des décharges par jeu ou par peur."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Todavía no domina el almacenamiento de electricidad y descargará un rayo si se divierte o asusta."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It is not yet skilled at storing electricity. It may send out a jolt if amused or startled."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"まだまだ 電気を ためるのが下手。 驚いたり 笑ったりすると すぐに 放電 してしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Pichu se charge plus facilement en électricité les jours d’orage ou lorsque l’air est très sec. On peut entendre le crépitement de l’électricité statique générée par ce Pokémon."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"A Pichu le resulta más fácil cargarse de electricidad en días de nubarrones o cuando sopla un aire muy seco. Es posible oír la electricidad estática que emana de este Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Pichu charges itself with electricity more easily on days with thunderclouds or when the air is very dry. You can hear the crackling of static electricity coming off this Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"雷雲が でている ときや 空気の 乾燥した 日は 電気が たまりやすい。 パチパチ 静電気の 音が 鳴っているよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Lorsque Pichu joue, il lui arrive de faire des courts-circuits avec un autre Pichu, créant ainsi une gerbe d’étincelles. Du coup, ce Pokémon prend peur et se met à pleurer."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Cuando Pichu juega con otros, puede liberar electricidad y producir una auténtica lluvia de chispas. Cuando esto ocurre, chilla asustado por tanta chispa."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"When Pichu plays with others, it may short out electricity with another Pichu, creating a shower of sparks. In that event, this Pokémon will begin crying, startled by the flash of sparks."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"仲間と 遊んでいるとき お互いの 電気が ショートして 火花を 出す ことが あるぞ。 火花に びっくり すると 泣き出してしまうよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il ne contrôle pas encore bien son électricité. Si on le laisse sans surveillance, il est capable de s’électrocuter lui-même."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"No controla muy bien la electricidad. Como su Entrenador se descuide, Pichu puede acabar paralizado por sus propias descargas."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It is not yet skilled at controlling electricity. If you take your eyes off it, it may shock itself."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"まだ 電気を 扱うのが ヘタ。 ちょっと 目を 離すと 自分の 電気で しびれていることも。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Bien qu’il soit adorable, il faut être prêt à supporter ses décharges électriques répétées si l’on veut vivre avec un Pichu."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Es un Pokémon adorable, pero cuando se convive con él, uno tiene que estar preparado para recibir alguna que otra descarga eléctrica."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Despite this Pokémon’s cute appearance, those who want to live with one should prepare to be on the receiving end of its electric jolts."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"可愛いけれど 一緒に暮らすなら 電気ショックで ビリビリに される 覚悟を しなければ いけないのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il ne contrôle pas encore bien l’électricité, et laisse échapper des décharges lorsqu’il est surpris ou en proie à de fortes émotions."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Aún no controla muy bien la electricidad, por lo que suele emitir descargas involuntarias cuando lo sorprenden o siente alguna emoción intensa."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It still can’t use electricity well. When it’s surprised or excited, it discharges electricity unintentionally."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"まだまだ 電気を 使うのが 下手。 驚いたり 気持ちが 高ぶると すぐに 放電 してしまうのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Les poches de ses joues renferment de l’électricité. Lorsqu’elles sont chargées, il a tellement d’énergie qu’il ne pense qu’à jouer."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Posee sacos eléctricos en los carrillos. Cuando se cargan por completo, se siente pletórico de energía y corre y juguetea sin parar."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It has electric sacs in its cheeks. When they’re fully charged, Pichu plays very energetically."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"ほっぺに 電気袋が ある。 充電 できているときは 元気いっぱい 遊びまわる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Malgré sa petite taille, il peut électrocuter de grandes personnes, ce qui le surprend également."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"A pesar de su pequeño tamaño, puede soltar descargas capaces de electrocutar a un adulto, si bien él también acaba sobresaltado."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Despite its small size, it can zap even adult humans. However, if it does so, it also surprises itself."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"小さくても 大人を ビリビリ させるほどの 電撃を 放てる。 ただし 自分も 驚いてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Les poches électriques de ses joues sont très petites. Lorsqu’elles sont surchargées, il s’électrocute lui-même."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Las bolsas de electricidad de sus mejillas son muy pequeñas y, a poco que se desborden, recibe una fuerte descarga."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"The electric sacs in its cheeks are small. If even a little electricity leaks, it becomes shocked."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"頬の 電気袋は 小さく ちょっとでも 電気が あふれると 自分自身が 痺れてしまう。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Pichu stores electricity in the sacs on its cheeks but discharges it inadvertently when agitated or excited. Being yet immature, the Pokémon's handling of electricity is rather inept."}],"varieties":[{"id":172,"moves":[{"name":"double-slap","learns":[[3,"egg",0],[4,"egg",0],[5,"egg",0],[6,"egg",0],[7,"egg",0],[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[10,"egg",0],[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0]]},{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[10,"egg",0],[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[16,"tutor",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"egg",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],